WEBVTT

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:38.870
Chief! The village to the east has gotten 
wind of the cursed Children of Maka!

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:42.970
We can't let Blue Notes Blues 
be tarred by this sin any more!

00:01:42.970 --> 00:01:44.940
Chief, make your decision!

00:01:56.950 --> 00:02:00.160
The unpleasantness is now frozen in the lake!

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:03.310
Future generations will surely 
laud our great actions!

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:14.370
200 Years of Solitude

00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:14.060
They weren't cursed children?

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:14.690
But that means...

00:02:15.210 --> 00:02:19.490
It was all the mayor's ancestor's doing! 
He's the one who got rid of the twins!

00:02:20.190 --> 00:02:21.010
That's...

00:02:21.010 --> 00:02:22.400
You knew, didn't you?

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:23.620
You knew, and yet...

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:26.930
It all happened before I was born!

00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:32.920
Besides, history isn't absolute truth! It's 
only what people now agree the past was like!

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:37.670
What?

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:39.490
Foolish human.

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:41.550
I have changed my mind.

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:44.350
This time, you fall victim to my whimsy.

00:02:45.870 --> 00:02:48.640
Humans... Begone, and perish!

00:03:01.100 --> 00:03:02.280
Niche...

00:03:03.590 --> 00:03:05.480
Why do you protect humans?

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:10.290
Sister. That story was about you and me.

00:03:12.050 --> 00:03:14.790
Must you continue playing 
this pointless game?

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:17.100
It's not a game! It's my job!

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:20.150
Lag's job is to deliver letters of heart.

00:03:20.150 --> 00:03:21.950
And I protect him!

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:24.260
No matter what happenes, that doesn't change!

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:26.000
Niche...

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:31.390
Is there... Is there nothing 
I can do for Niche?

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:36.090
Unable to grow up out in the world...

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:41.000
And choosing to work as some human's servant?

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:43.360
Sister, you are so pitiful...

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:48.160
Perhaps it is best if I 
end your life as well?

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:53.250
Stooge.

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:00.890
Weak.

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:01.590
Weak!

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:04.220
Frail!

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:09.180
Niche!

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:16.420
I will finish you. This 
is where we say goodbye...

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:20.820
Farewell, my sister...

00:04:39.820 --> 00:04:44.540
What is it that has entered inside of me?

00:04:54.900 --> 00:04:59.190
At the train station in Yodaka, it was 
almost like she'd been abandoned...

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:02.440
U-Um...

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:08.450
From inside a dark niche, sea blue 
eyes stared intently at me...

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:14.210
I'm not a Letter Bee yet, so if I deliver 
her, the regulations don't apply. Right, Connor?

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:14.840
Right?

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:17.070
L-Lag...

00:05:17.070 --> 00:05:20.960
She's just like I was that time...

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:23.840
So, I just can't leave her like that.

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:29.310
My mission is to deliver you to your 
destination, Love Someone Down.

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:32.020
I'm Lag Seeing.

00:05:32.020 --> 00:05:33.720
Won't you tell me your name?

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:38.780
My plan was to save a little girl.

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:40.940
My name? Maka.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:44.930
Maka, huh? That's a pretty 
great name you have there...

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:45.700
Jenny...

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:46.610
Carol...

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:47.240
Susan...

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:48.480
Elizabeth...

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:49.280
Kerry...

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:50.060
Jinmei...

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:50.950
Abbey...

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:52.200
I have many others.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:54.600
What is your real name?

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:55.730
I don't have one.

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:57.460
You don't have one?

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:58.800
Is there one you like?

00:05:58.800 --> 00:05:59.680
No.

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:03.770
T-Then... Is it okay for me 
to give you a temporary name?

00:06:06.020 --> 00:06:07.270
Um...

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:08.470
Let's see...

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:10.950
Niche...

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:13.470
That's it! How about Niche?

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:16.300
Niche?

00:06:19.550 --> 00:06:21.100
Lag Seeing.

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:26.050
You are the first man who has 
ever gotten me to wear underwear!

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:32.530
I've decided to use the 
name you gave me, "Niche."

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:37.330
Call me Niche, Lag.

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:42.210
But I was the one who ended up being saved...

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:47.710
Lag, if saying goodbye is so sad for 
you, then I'll stay by your side.

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:50.220
Niche...

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.220
Does saying goodbye make you sad?

00:06:54.410 --> 00:07:02.100
Say... Just suppose I lost my 
heart and forgot about you, Niche.

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:03.830
What would you do?

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:07.090
Don't worry.

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:10.150
Even if you forget me, Lag...

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:12.750
I'll never forget you, see?

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:14.940
So we'll always be together!

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:22.280
What has been placed inside of me?

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:26.710
Your feelings... Your 
feelings for my sister...

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:30.720
Have you just shot into me...

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:34.640
...your own heart?

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:38.010
Niche?

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:41.700
Niche!

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:42.730
Niche!

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:44.570
Niche, hang in there...

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:48.230
Always be together?

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:53.940
Maka and human have formed a bond?

00:07:57.850 --> 00:08:01.870
Some nerve you have, foolish human!

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:07.310
Hey, did you bring some of the water 
that'll let you live for 1000 years?

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:08.750
Just a bit!

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.150
What are you thinking?!

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:12.430
Mayor, we ain't givin' any to you!

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:16.740
A creature who can't discern 
right and wrong for herself,

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:19.410
forgetting the heart of the Maka...

00:08:19.410 --> 00:08:21.790
Forgetting the crimes 
committed against you...

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:25.350
And you're aiding the foolish 
humans, you pitiful sister of mine!

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:29.650
So, so wretched!

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:31.850
Wretched beyond all imagination!

00:08:31.850 --> 00:08:34.700
Begone! Begone, all of you!

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:36.030
Begone!

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:38.120
Begone!

00:08:48.410 --> 00:08:51.040
So, so wretched!

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:53.150
Wretched beyond all imagination!

00:08:53.150 --> 00:08:56.900
Begone! Begone, all of you!

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:06.690
Steak, take care of Niche!

00:09:19.930 --> 00:09:23.290
Humans are foolish?

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:27.520
Isn't someone who hurts 
their own sister foolish?

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:30.200
Isn't the Maka foolish?

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:32.710
Is there a living creature that isn't foolish?

00:09:34.180 --> 00:09:36.500
If you hurt Niche any more...

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:39.760
Even if you are her sister, I 
won't let you get away with it!

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:42.630
Spirit Amber in your eye?

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:48.140
It turned to amber with a considerable 
amount of energy left in it.

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:51.980
Perhaps that is why you 
don't smell like a human?

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:55.720
No, that's not it... What exactly are you?

00:09:56.520 --> 00:10:02.100
Well, no matter. This is where 
you say goodbye to my sister.

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:22.740
Sister... If we hadn't parted then, 
we would be here together as Maka...

00:10:27.030 --> 00:10:28.640
Farewell, my sister.

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:30.350
Don't do it!

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:36.550
She not "human" or "Maka"...

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:38.040
Niche is Niche!

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:41.270
She's Niche, and she's very important to me!

00:10:48.780 --> 00:10:50.040
Here's your tip.

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:52.920
Thanks a lot!

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:54.570
Niche...

00:10:54.950 --> 00:10:56.110
Thank you.

00:10:57.280 --> 00:10:59.970
Lag, farewell.

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:03.500
Wait!

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:05.600
Don't go!

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:07.850
Don't go!

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:11.150
Where are you going?

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:14.900
Niche!

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:16.760
Always...

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:20.800
You're...

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:23.200
Always...

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:25.530
We were always together...

00:11:26.770 --> 00:11:27.860
I remember.

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:32.290
The dark room where even 
starlight couldn't reach...

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:39.600
When I would open my eyes, she 
would always be there, beside me...

00:11:54.260 --> 00:11:57.570
We were always a pair...

00:11:58.100 --> 00:12:00.890
Disgusting monsters...

00:12:00.890 --> 00:12:03.500
We should have gotten rid 
of them a long time ago.

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:06.460
We were afraid of the Maka, 
so we didn't touch them.

00:12:06.460 --> 00:12:09.630
But with the Maka not 
showing itself for so long,

00:12:09.630 --> 00:12:12.670
either it perished in the famine,

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:15.920
or it has no interest in these things.

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:19.780
Chief, make your decision!

00:12:43.310 --> 00:12:44.530
Wake up!

00:12:45.650 --> 00:12:46.910
Wake up!

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:51.200
You're being swept away by the water!

00:12:57.570 --> 00:13:01.720
Farther away... Disappearing...

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:06.600
We were always... always together...

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:11.350
Me and my sister...

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:19.750
What?

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:21.190
Where am I?

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:24.610
My sister... isn't here...

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:26.300
Sister!

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:28.820
I'm...

00:13:30.470 --> 00:13:33.400
...all alone now...

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:44.690
Sadness... Loneliness...

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:48.350
Sadness... Loneliness!

00:13:48.350 --> 00:13:50.060
Sister!

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:03.320
I wonder how much time passed...

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:07.030
When the huge waves of emotions had subsided,

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:09.630
I had grown up.

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:14.820
Furthermore, I realized what 
I was and what I should do.

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:18.930
The memories of the Maka,
etched inside of me...

00:14:19.810 --> 00:14:25.500
As if I was following nature's 
call, I made my way to this place.

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:29.880
And so, you didn't try to search for Niche?

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:38.340
If she matured like I did, then she 
would surely be led to this place.

00:14:38.970 --> 00:14:43.270
If she could not survive without my help,

00:14:43.810 --> 00:14:46.650
she would have no right to 
inherit the Maka's duty.

00:14:48.410 --> 00:14:50.730
So that's why you were always...

00:14:55.800 --> 00:14:58.550
You're the fool!

00:14:58.550 --> 00:15:02.100
You have a sister you want to see 
more than anyone else in the world...

00:15:02.450 --> 00:15:05.300
A sister who you were always together with...

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:09.370
And yet you waited here, 
alone, for 200 years?

00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:12.660
Even humans aren't that foolish!

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:16.550
We could never be so wonderfully foolish!

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:22.630
You say some funny things.

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:25.940
So I am the fool?

00:15:27.520 --> 00:15:29.830
You're saying that in the end,

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:33.660
I can't escape being born of a foolish human?

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:44.040
Niche!

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:45.690
Do not worry.

00:15:47.140 --> 00:15:51.090
The Maka is simply taking her to Tir na lake.

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:54.360
Tir na lake?

00:15:54.360 --> 00:15:58.650
There's a lake inside the 
cave which can heal wounds.

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:07.850
Although, the rumored lake that'll let you 
live 1000 years... That just doesn't exist.

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:10.470
Wow, she makes that face, too...

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:13.490
It's no fair! Why am I the only 
one that doesn't get some?

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:15.000
Let go!

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:17.010
That's enough already, Mayor!

00:16:17.010 --> 00:16:17.940
Mayor!

00:16:17.940 --> 00:16:19.490
Shut up! Hand over the water!

00:16:19.800 --> 00:16:22.120
I wanna live for 1000 years, too!

00:16:23.630 --> 00:16:24.750
Mayor!

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:26.200
It's cold!

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:27.790
I'm freezing! I'm freezing!

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:29.860
Help me! Help me!

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:35.250
Would you please tell me something?

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:38.950
What are the creatures inside 
of the pillars of ice?

00:16:39.980 --> 00:16:45.800
They begin to metamorphose after 
they shed that last bit of heart.

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:49.650
The Maka, in order to prevent the 
world order from falling into chaos,

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:52.710
froze them before their 
metamorphosis was carried out,

00:16:52.710 --> 00:16:55.230
and trapped them here in this land.

00:16:55.230 --> 00:16:58.810
When will Niche return, do you think?

00:16:59.590 --> 00:17:03.440
The Tir na lake can heal one's wounds,

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:06.350
but it does take some time.

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:10.100
Let us keep her until then.

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:16.470
Do not worry. As soon as she is 
cured, we will return her to your side.

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:23.270
One day, my sister will surely 
experience strong waves of emotion,

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:25.140
and come to maturity...

00:17:25.990 --> 00:17:30.190
Until that time, I wish
for her to be with you.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:33.690
You, whose heart goes out
to her more than any other.

00:17:34.690 --> 00:17:36.070
Thank you...

00:17:37.010 --> 00:17:41.890
I know well how sad saying goodbye can be.

00:17:46.900 --> 00:17:51.580
She said that your job 
was delivering "letters."

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:53.400
Yes.

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:55.370
What are letters?

00:17:57.970 --> 00:18:01.690
Letters are people's hearts themselves.

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:03.350
Heart?

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:06.600
What happens when someone receives a letter?

00:18:08.050 --> 00:18:12.150
They can be happy or have 
their own heart shaken up...

00:18:14.520 --> 00:18:18.820
Then the letter you brought 
to us was my sister.

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:23.150
You did well to deliver her, Lag.

00:18:24.070 --> 00:18:27.430
Please... Please take good care of Niche!

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:30.230
Best wishes to you!

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:40.930
I commend you for the arduous job 
you've done these hundreds of years!

00:18:42.840 --> 00:18:44.190
If you'll excuse me!

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:51.870
Li...gh...t...

00:18:53.910 --> 00:18:55.370
That's the Light?

00:18:56.350 --> 00:18:57.280
It couldn't be...

00:18:59.600 --> 00:19:03.530
We must wait for Lag to grow 
a little before we find out

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:08.080
whether he is a human or merely 
something taking the form of a human.

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:11.580
It seems we have something 
to look forward to.

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:14.790
Letters are heart.

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:22.110
Those who deliver heart...

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:40.970
Next: Veritably Abbey
